Ella Fitzgerald covered the song during live performances starting in the late 1960s, as captured on 1968's Sunshine of Your Love and Live At Montreux 1969. A version by the Japanese metal band Gastunk appeared at number 83 on the Oricon singles chart on December 12, 1988.{{sfn|Oricon|1998|p=92}}

